--- !u!114 &165128138
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 165128137}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 086191d180fbc5d419bb4594bd1ecda3, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  dialogueText:
  - Oh no...
  - Hi! This kind of thing isn't supposed to happen!
  - Our meteor detection software lacks lifeform analyzers.
  - But this hasn't happened in thousands of years.
  - Can you understand me? Is my auto-translator working?
  - Ah, good, you have a pickaxe. You'll probably need it to escape.
  - You'll need a little extra juice to smash through the stuff in here.
  - I can give you some per room.
  - You just have to find the teleport pad in each room.
  - It'll take you to another part of the ship.
  - You'll find the control room eventually.
  - From there you can stop the ship and signal home.
  - Just so you know, there's nobody on this ship. It's machine-run.
  - 'If a person from my home planet was here they''d surely have detected you. '
  - Well, whatever. Oh, right! Almost forgot.
  - I can flip your gravity!
  - The gravity in the ship is entirely artificial,
  - ' so I can modify your sensors to flip you upside down.'
  - 'Just press [SPACE!]'
  - If you need any help, press [F]. I'll give you a hint.
  AIBuddyNPC: {fileID: 1212845074}
